=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
  timesync default ---------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Proposed: no Figma frame. web-01.example.net runs Ubuntu$
# 26.04, whose time service is chrony. The clock is in sync on$
# Ubuntu's own pools, and hardn.yml names no servers: the item$
# stays and says what is missing.$
$
# NTP Settings #################################################$
$
  [+] NTP                  + 2.ntp.ubuntu.com$
$
  Time ---------------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  Service              chrony$
  [+] Clock                In sync$
   -  Synced to            2.ntp.ubuntu.com$
   -  Server               1.ntp.ubuntu.com$
   -  Server               2.ntp.ubuntu.com$
   -  Server               3.ntp.ubuntu.com$
   -  Server               4.ntp.ubuntu.com$
   -  Server               ntp-bootstrap.ubuntu.com$
   -  hardn.yml            No servers$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Set servers          No servers in hardn.yml$
   2) Refresh              Read the host again$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Option [0-2 or q]:$
$
$

